Kozmikreis;

Yeah I am not sure how to explain them. I don't want to run them all as
it's a bit slow which is probably due to my use of "CoreData."

How would you order the data and group them?

I have changed the button from a (>) button to an actual button which says
search, but I have kept it where it is, so it doesn't get covered by the
keyboard. I am not sure if there is a good existing design pattern for what
I have done. I am waiting for "approval."

I have also fixed the Text Search feature, and it's now capable of running
on older devices which can't upgrade to iOS 4.3. (I am not too sure how far
back I can go before I loose the features I am using.)

